// HIDDEN REBUILD, called at the end of every draft mutation. It is a
// control rather than a behaviour UDF because it reads _cmpWfExpanded,
// and it is wrapped by the Rebuild action so the host can call it too.
//
// The two step collect through colWfRowsTmp is required: a ClearCollect
// whose source reads the collection it is clearing has undefined
// behaviour.
//
// PhaseDays and StatusTitle are now PROJECTED HERE ONCE. The duration
// aggregate used to be copy pasted into three places (the chip, the
// phase row and the footer) and re-evaluated on every render of each.
// StatusTitle removes a per render LookUp against nfStatusTable from every
// pill and tooltip.
//
// DURATION IS THE SUM OF THE LONGEST WORKER AT EACH ORDER, not the sum
// of every worker. Workers sharing an order run in parallel, so three
// three-day workers at order 1 cost three days, not nine.
//
// All three record shapes carry the SAME COLUMN SET. A Collect whose
// records disagree on columns silently widens the collection schema.
//
// A locked phase DOES contribute worker rows, so a Completed phase can
